    "body": "Hi, Team!\r\nPlease review our bid adapter update.\r\n\r\n## Type of change\r\n- [x] Updated bidder adapter  <!--  IMPORTANT: (1) consider whether you need to upgrade your bidder parameter documentation in https://github.com/prebid/prebid.github.io/tree/master/dev-docs/bidders and (2) if you have a Prebid Server adapter, please consider whether that should be updated as well. --> \r\n\r\n## Description of change\r\n- Added: Support for enriching the request payload with payload.userIdAsEids.\r\n- Removed: payload.eids from the request payload.\r\n- Changed: Restructured the payload so that bids contains all placements, allowing them to be included in a single request.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nArthur Buchatsky",
